      "linkedin\\011_2026-09-20_digital-sat-prep\\011_2026-09-20_digital-sat-prep.png"
    ],
    "caption": "Why pay $100/hour for SAT prep that isn't personalized?\n\nEvery year, families shell out billions for SAT prep.\n\nYet, the traditional approach treats every student the same.\n\nPrepifyMe is changing the script.\n\nImagine practice that's laser-focused on the exact areas where students struggle — no wasted time, no 'one-size-fits-all'.\n\nThis isn't just adaptive learning; this is precision:\n\n1. Tailored practice per skill — targets what's wrong.\n2. AI-tailored difficulty — grows with the student.\n3. Full Digital-SAT coverage, Math & R&W — think Bluebook format.\n\nAdd gamification:\n\n- Streaks, leagues, and competition make studying engaging.\n- A scholarship sweepstakes transforms effort into opportunity — leveling up means a shot at tuition.\n\nFree on the App Store and prepifyme.com, this isn't expensive legacy prep. \n\nIt's next-gen learning that costs nothing yet delivers everything.\n\nYour support helps build the future of education — no subscriptions, no barriers.\n\nSee PrepifyMe live at prepifyme.com — free today.\n\n#edtech #SATprep #AI #scholarships",
